    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκρῐτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for compounding</i>, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακριτικός, τμῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					282c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				107b30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκὸν μὲν τὸ διακριτικὸν μέλαν δὲ τὸ
					ς.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Sens.</u>
					86
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> l.c. b,c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>comparative</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόθεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.616d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνόματα</span>) <i>comparative degree</i> of
			adjectives, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				635.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.677d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				58.28
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					9.75
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετασυγκριτικός, φάρμακα</span>
			, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλαστικά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.343
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς.</span>, title of work by
			Thessalus, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				10.7
			</span></i>.</div>
